# Cursor Instructions

## Before Any Task
Read AGENT.md first for project context, rules, and workflows.

## Quick Reference
- Project: Stock analysis platform for Indian Equity Market (NSE)
- Backend: Python/Flask, MongoDB, Redis, TA-Lib, vectorbt
- Frontend: Next.js 15.5, React 19, Tailwind CSS v4
- Strategies: JSON-configured in backend/strategies/
- Data cache: backend/data/historical/ (date-stamped parquet files)
- Workflows: .agent/workflows/

## Key Rules
- Use vectorized operations (no Python loops over DataFrames)
- Never bypass circuit_breaker or risk controls
- New strategies go in backend/strategies/*.json
- Indicator modules inherit from BaseStrategy in backend/scripts/strategies/
- Check .agent/workflows/ before starting implementation tasks
